{"ts":"2026-09-02T04:10:57.812Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/critical-placement-authoritative-evidence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["fresh-seed-critical-set-fully-inspected","seed-concentrated-placement-is-known-not-converged","spread-placement-is-known-converged","partial-spread-names-the-pending-partitions","required-rf-resolves-through-the-policy-authority","absent-policy-evidence-is-unknown-never-known-not-converged","one-malformed-policy-keeps-only-that-evidence-unknown","bootstrap-expected-rf-cannot-turn-unknown-into-known","unreadable-cache-is-typed-unknown","stale-topology-evidence-cannot-authorize-current-topology","observer-mints-no-readiness-state","barrier-release-is-unchanged-by-the-observation","witness-deterministic"]}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/critical-placement-authoritative-evidence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["fresh-seed-critical-set-fully-inspected","seed-concentrated-placement-is-known-not-converged","spread-placement-is-known-converged","partial-spread-names-the-pending-partitions","required-rf-resolves-through-the-policy-authority","absent-policy-evidence-is-unknown-never-known-not-converged","one-malformed-policy-keeps-only-that-evidence-unknown","bootstrap-expected-rf-cannot-turn-unknown-into-known","unreadable-cache-is-typed-unknown","stale-topology-evidence-cannot-authorize-current-topology","observer-mints-no-readiness-state","barrier-release-is-unchanged-by-the-observation","witness-deterministic"]}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"Critical-placement convergence is a three-state authoritative observation: the convergence owner resolves each critical partition's required replication factor exclusively through the replication-target policy authority on that partition's persisted partitions row, distinguishes UNKNOWN (policy evidence absent or malformed, or evidence surfaces unreadable) from KNOWN_NOT_CONVERGED (valid policy, measured distinct-voting-holder deficit) from KNOWN_CONVERGED (valid policy, measured satisfaction), stamps the observation with the membership publication epoch it was computed under so a superseded topology's KNOWN_CONVERGED can never authorize the current one, and is reported by the formation barrier as typed evidence without changing any release decision. Bootstrap expected RF and initial replica-id identity counts cannot supply a requirement and cannot turn UNKNOWN into a KNOWN state. This quest observes; it repairs no placement behaviour and leaves the move-planner target divergence to S6b.","title":null,"class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"three-state-evidence-mandatory","statement":"The observation vocabulary is exactly UNKNOWN, KNOWN_NOT_CONVERGED, KNOWN_CONVERGED. Absent or malformed policy evidence is UNKNOWN and never either KNOWN state; a measured deficit under valid policy is KNOWN_NOT_CONVERGED; no boolean surface may collapse UNKNOWN into KNOWN_NOT_CONVERGED. A `converged` boolean may exist only as the strict projection state === KNOWN_CONVERGED."},{"id":"authority-sole-requirement-source","statement":"The convergence owner's required replica count resolves only through resolveDesiredReplicationFactor on the persisted partitions policy row. getInitialReplicaIds, identity counts, schema creation defaults, table-policy fallbacks, and local literals are forbidden requirement sources in this owner. Where the authority decodes UNDECLARED, the requirement is unknown and the evidence is UNKNOWN."},{"id":"topology-binding-reuses-membership-epoch-owner","statement":"Evidence is stamped with the membership publication epoch from the existing topology_membership_owner (membership-epoch-contract.js) read from the same system-table cache. No local generation counter is minted. An unavailable epoch leaves the stamp typed unavailable, which the epoch fence resolves to UNKNOWN currency; it does not erase the placement measurement."},{"id":"observation-only-no-placement-repair","statement":"This Quest changes no placement, move, scheduling, or admission behaviour and gates nothing: the formation barrier's release decision is bit-identical with and without the observation. The move-planner placement-target divergence (policy.targetReplicaCount || policy.replicaCount || NUM.THREE via the table-policy fallback) remains untouched and transferred to S6b."},{"id":"critical-set-vocabulary-not-duplicated","statement":"The critical partition set comes only from CRITICAL_SYSTEM_PARTITION_IDS in system-partition-classification.js; no test or module restates the critical count as a literal."},{"id":"deterministic-first","statement":"Proof is a deterministic raw node:test witness with one anchored scenario per receipt, and a mutation matrix in which guessing UNKNOWN into a KNOWN state, restoring an identity-count or schema-default requirement source, or dropping the epoch stamp each reds at least one named receipt."}],"verificationTemplates":[],"landingRequirements":null,"frontierIds":["critical-placement-authoritative-evidence-main"]}}
{"ts":"2026-09-02T04:56:16.492Z","type":"attempt","frontier":"critical-placement-authoritative-evidence-main","rung":"observe","rungIndex":1,"prevRungIndex":0,"hypothesis":"S3: three-state authoritative critical-placement evidence. The convergence owner resolves required RF exclusively through resolveDesiredReplicationFactor on the persisted partitions row (identity-count source removed; witness renamed required-count-derives-from-authoritative-policy; v4 solve-record lineage deferred to a separate bookkeeping commit per changeRef scope). Vocabulary UNKNOWN/KNOWN_NOT_CONVERGED/KNOWN_CONVERGED per partition and aggregate: deficit dominates, any unknown blocks KNOWN_CONVERGED, empty set is UNKNOWN, converged boolean is strictly state==KNOWN_CONVERGED. New observer reads SERVICES+PARTITIONS+CONTROL_PLANE_PUBLICATIONS, types each unreadable surface UNKNOWN, stamps the membership publication epoch, and resolveCriticalPlacementEvidenceCurrency is the single evidence-to-currency boundary over the membership epoch owner's fence (STALE/FUTURE/UNKNOWN all refuse; no local generation counter). Formation barrier reports the observation in snapshot+log fields and provably does not gate on it (release identical across all four states with/without observation; registered pair formation-release-seed-contract-joiner-consumer witnesses green 169 assertions). Cost made join-loop-safe: aggregate was ~45x redundant (~55ms/observation, measured), now copy-once/index-once ~2.5ms with witnesses unchanged. Witness 14/14, receipt 13/13, five-mutation kill matrix reds named receipts, 87-file join/rebalance systemic net green except the known in-flight src-delta gate and the multijoin 7th-node join failure which reproduces under machine load independent of observer cost (deferred cool-machine A/B recorded).","changeRef":"diff:solve/changes/critical-placement-authoritative-evidence/attempt-1.diff.json","metricBefore":null,"metricAfter":0,"metricDirection":"lower-is-better","invalidSample":false